WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.500
Speaker 1: So after his completely farcical
presidential announcement on Twitter spaces,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.210
Florida Republican Governor Ron DeSantis gave
his first interview as a presidential candidate.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:16.760
He gave this interview to Trey Gowdy, who
was guest hosting on Fox News.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.289
And DeSantis suffered what I call a talking
point coma.

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:24.449
He couldn't stop repeating the word woke.

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:28.599
He also threw in an anti-Semitic conspiracy
theory for good measure.

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:29.599
Right.

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:31.590
I mean, he is running as a Republican after
all.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.890
Let's take a look at this.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:37.040
And this is just if you thought the announcement
was bad.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.410
When DeSantis actually gets a chance to speak,
it gets even worse.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:42.539
So let's start there.

00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:44.910
Here is Ron DeSantis with a talking point.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.840
Coma can't stop saying woke.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:51.210
Speaker 2: Well, first of all, the woke mind
virus is basically a form of cultural Marxism.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.399
At the end of the day, it's an attack on the
truth.

00:00:54.399 --> 00:00:59.290
And because it's a war on truth, I think we
have no choice but to wage a war on woke.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.059
So how does that work for a president?

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:07.710
Some of it may be the bully pulpit being willing
to tell the truth and not being deluded by

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.780
ideology, which we see in many aspects of
our society.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:11.830
Speaker 1: There you go.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.619
So woke, woke, woke.

00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:16.030
Florida is where woke goes to die.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.549
We will end woke.

00:01:17.549 --> 00:01:24.530
So please understand that the term cultural
Marxism is nothing but a far right wing conspiracy

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:25.950
theory.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:26.950
That is.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:27.950
Let me too.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:33.520
To put it lightly, often tinged with anti-Semitism,
I get emails every time one of these right

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.920
wingers starts talking about cultural Marxism.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.079
People write and say, David, what the hell?

00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:38.170
I know Marxism.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.920
The economic theory.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.979
What on earth is cultural Marxism?

00:01:41.979 --> 00:01:45.190
When the right uses the term cultural Marxism?

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.210
They are talking about a supposedly leftist
agenda that wants to undermine traditional

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.210
values.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.270
It wants to erode societal norms.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:58.390
It wants to promote political correctness
and police, police speech and this sort of

00:01:58.390 --> 00:01:59.390
thing.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:05.909
Often what they accuse George Soros of is
tantamount to the very cultural Marxism they

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:06.909
claim exists.

00:02:06.909 --> 00:02:13.300
And they say that this so-called cultural
Marxism is a conspiracy propagated by left

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:17.879
wing intellectuals, left wing activists, Democrats,
etc.

00:02:17.879 --> 00:02:23.270
They want to infiltrate and control institutions,
including academia, media, entertainment,

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.790
and they want to reshape culture to fit their
ideology.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:33.709
Now, according to that perspective, cultural
Marxists are accused of manipulating language,

00:02:33.709 --> 00:02:40.019
promoting and using identity politics, advocating
for social justice issues and LGBT rights

00:02:40.019 --> 00:02:46.150
and so on and so forth, at the expense of
individual freedoms and liberty and so on

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:47.420
and so forth.

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:53.430
The most important thing to understand about
so-called cultural Marxism is that it essentially

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.430
does not exist.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:03:00.690
And what I mean by that is Marxism focuses
on economic structures and class struggle.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.580
That's the first thing to understand.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:07.500
It doesn't actually focus on cultural or social
issues, although Marxism does acknowledge

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.060
that culture and society will be shaped by
the economic system.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.060
That's number one.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:14.610
So even the term doesn't really make sense.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:22.150
Secondly, the entire emergence of the term
cultural Marxism came from a misinterpretation

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:23.989
of actual Marxism.

00:03:23.989 --> 00:03:25.810
That's number two and the number three.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.790
There's also no Marxists in the United States.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:34.030
Now, I know you might go to, you know, the
local Magic the Gathering tournament and meet

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:39.680
an actual Marxist who understands Marxist
ideology and says they subscribe to it.

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.220
And I'm not insulting magic the gathering.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:45.700
I'm just saying you might be able to find
someone somewhere who's actually a marxist.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:50.299
There is not a single Marxist in a position
of power in federal government that I can

00:03:50.299 --> 00:03:51.660
think of in the United States.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:56.860
So when the right talks about cultural Marxism,
they don't even really know what they're talking

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:57.860
about.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.810
It's not Marxism, it doesn't exist, and it's
thinly veiled anti-Semitism.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:05.959
So but that wasn't the worst moment of this
entire thing.

